    "finalText": "Done. The implementation is complete and verified:\n\n- **`start.sh`** — runs `node migrate.js` then `exec node server.js` (foreground, `0.0.0.0:8000`); deps installed via `npm install` (`pg` added)\n- **`migrate.js` + `migrations/001_create_links.sql`** — idempotent, tracked in `schema_migrations`, with advisory lock\n- **`db.js`** — pool reads `DATABASE_URL` from env, no hard-coded credentials\n- **`server.js`** — all endpoints: create (201/409), read (200/404), redirect with atomic single increment (302/404), list in creation order, and 422 JSON errors for malformed JSON/invalid url/code\n- **`README.md`** — startup section included\n\nTested the full matrix: validation, duplicates, redirects, concurrent increments (20 parallel → exactly +20), and restart persistence. Port 8000 is free for the test suite."
